[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Run as a Windows app
Name[bg]=Пусни като програма за Windows
Comment=Runs Windows programs with Proton, each in its own Windows folder
Comment[bg]=Пуска програми за Windows с Proton, всяка в своя папка на Windows
Exec=tuxos-winapp open %f
Icon=wine
NoDisplay=true
MimeType=application/x-ms-dos-executable;application/x-msdownload;application/vnd.microsoft.portable-executable;application/x-msi;application/x-ms-installer;application/x-ole-storage;
